// The control `many_unused.gos` is measured against: the same entry and the
// same one reachable function, with none of the dead weight. Comparing the
// two isolates what the unreached code costs, where comparing against a
// program that prints something else would also measure the difference
// between their two formatting paths.

fn used(a: i64) -> i64 { a * 2 }

fn main() {
    println("{}", used(21))
}
